{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10413030","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10413030","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1041303001:1":{"text":"Bryon's companion, Elona, is so beautiful. Her eyes are as clear as diamonds. Her feathers are as smooth as silk.","source_cn":"布莱恩的艾洛娜很漂亮哇，她的眼睛像宝石一样单良，羽毛也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x907D4B4D88458D42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041303002:1":{"text":"Elona is so powerful too. Her talons are so fierce, and her beak is long and sharp!","source_cn":"满满觉得艾洛娜很威武，她的爪子强有力，鹰喙尖又长！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4D53AC0B0C557A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041303003:0":{"text":"Bryon, can we touch her? Just a little touch!","source_cn":"布莱恩，我们可不可以摸摸她？只摸一下就好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9097DBF386738BC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041303004:1":{"text":"Just a friendly reminder. One of Elona's favorite meals is rodent. She just loves them.","source_cn":"友情提醒：啮齿类生物在艾洛娜的食谱里。而且，她很喜欢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22B006F1E5DDBF08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041303005:0":{"text":"Forget it then!","source_cn":"——那、那还是算了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"